#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:201
msgid "CHGNet：LAMMPSによる単点全エネルギー計算"
msgstr "CHGNet: Single-Point Total Energy Calculation with LAMMPS"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:203
msgid ""
"以下の ``in.QuloudJob`` は、``QuloudJob.lmp`` に記述された構造を読み込み、\\ CHGNet により "
"``run 0`` の単点エネルギー計算を実行する入力例です。\\ Ti の変位量は ``in.QuloudJob`` "
"ではなく、``QuloudJob.lmp`` の Atoms セクションで変更します。"
msgstr ""
"The example ``in.QuloudJob`` reads the structure in ``QuloudJob.lmp`` and"
" \\  evaluates the single-point energy with CHGNet using ``run 0``. \\  "
"The Ti displacement is not set in ``in.QuloudJob``. Change it in the "
"Atoms section of ``QuloudJob.lmp``."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:207
msgid ""
":math:`a_0 = 4.036` Å の場合、理想的な Ti の Cartesian z 座標は ``2.018 Å`` です。\\ "
"したがって、``+0.08 Å`` の変位では Ti の z 座標を ``2.098 Å``、\\ ``-0.08 Å`` の変位では "
"``1.938 Å`` とします。Quloud が付与した原子 ID はジョブごとに確認し、\\ 元素タイプが Ti に対応する行の z "
"座標だけを変更します。"
msgstr ""
"For :math:`a_0 = 4.036` Å, the ideal Cartesian z coordinate of Ti is "
"``2.018 Å``. \\  For a displacement of ``+0.08 Å``, set the Ti z "
"coordinate to ``2.098 Å``, and for \\  ``-0.08 Å``, set it to ``1.938 "
"Å``. Check the atom IDs assigned by Quloud for each job, \\  and edit "
"only the z coordinate in the row whose atom type corresponds to Ti."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:218
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"# CHGNet/LAMMPS single-point total-energy calculation\n"
"\n"
"units metal\n"
"boundary p p p\n"
"atom_style atomic\n"
"\n"
"read_data QuloudJob.lmp\n"
"\n"
"pair_style chgnet ../../../../../../../../CHGNET\n"
"pair_coeff * * 0.3.0 Ba Ti O\n"
"\n"
"thermo_style custom step pe etotal temp density vol press\n"
"thermo 1\n"
"\n"
"run 0\n"
"\n"
"variable Epe equal pe\n"
"variable Etot equal etotal\n"
"variable V equal vol\n"
"variable P equal press\n"
"\n"
"print \"pe_eV ${Epe}\" file singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"etotal_eV ${Etot}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"volume_A3 ${V}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"pressure_bar ${P}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat"
msgstr ""
"# CHGNet/LAMMPS single-point total-energy calculation\n"
"\n"
"units metal\n"
"boundary p p p\n"
"atom_style atomic\n"
"\n"
"read_data QuloudJob.lmp\n"
"\n"
"pair_style chgnet ../../../../../../../../CHGNET\n"
"pair_coeff * * 0.3.0 Ba Ti O\n"
"\n"
"thermo_style custom step pe etotal temp density vol press\n"
"thermo 1\n"
"\n"
"run 0\n"
"\n"
"variable Epe equal pe\n"
"variable Etot equal etotal\n"
"variable V equal vol\n"
"variable P equal press\n"
"\n"
"print \"pe_eV ${Epe}\" file singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"etotal_eV ${Etot}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"volume_A3 ${V}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat\n"
"print \"pressure_bar ${P}\" append singlepoint_energy.dat"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:251
msgid ""
