#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:420
msgid "考察"
msgstr "Discussion"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:422
msgid ""
":math:`a_0` では、SevenNet と FairChem は DFT と同様に小変位領域で負の曲率を示し、\\ "
"BaTiO₃の強誘電的不安定性を確認するうえで有効です。\\ 一方、CHGNet は全変位範囲でのMAEは小さいものの、小変位領域の曲率を\\ "
"十分に再現していないため、:math:`a_0` における強誘電的不安定性の評価には注意が必要です。"
msgstr ""
"At :math:`a_0`, SevenNet and FairChem show negative curvature at small "
"displacements, as DFT does, \\  making them useful for identifying the "
"ferroelectric instability in BaTiO₃. \\  Although CHGNet has a small MAE "
"across the full displacement range, it does not adequately reproduce the "
"curvature \\  at small displacements, so it should be used with care to "
"assess the ferroelectric instability at :math:`a_0`."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:427
msgid ""
":math:`1.05a_0` では、すべての MLIP で Ti "
"が中心からずれるとエネルギーが下がり、強誘電性に伴う二重井戸が定性的に再現されました。\\ しかし、SevenNet と FairChem "
"は大変位領域でDFTよりも井戸を深く評価しており、\\ 大振幅変位に対する非調和的なエネルギー壁を過小評価しています。\\ CHGNet は "
":math:`a_0` では小変位領域の不安定性を過小評価しますが、:math:`1.05a_0` の大変位領域では\\ "
"DFTに比較的近いエネルギー上昇を示します。"
msgstr ""
"At :math:`1.05a_0`, moving Ti off center lowered the energy in all MLIPs,"
" qualitatively reproducing the double wells associated with "
"ferroelectricity. \\  However, SevenNet and FairChem give deeper wells "
"than DFT at large displacements \\  and underestimate the anharmonic "
"energy walls at large displacement amplitudes. \\  CHGNet underestimates "
"the instability at small displacements at :math:`a_0`, but at large "
"displacements at :math:`1.05a_0`, \\  it gives an energy rise relatively "
"close to the DFT result."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:433
msgid ""
"Sehrawatらは、BaTiO₃に特化して学習されたACEポテンシャルが、\\ DFT の二重井戸ポテンシャルをよく再現し、特に大きな Ti "
"変位\\ （0.1 Å 以上）においてもDFTとの差が概ね 20 meV/f.u. 以内であることを\\ 報告しています "
":sup:`[1]`。本計算では、:math:`a_0` の各 MLIP と DFT の差は\\ "
"比較的小さいですが、:math:`1.05a_0` の大変位領域では SevenNet と FairChem の\\ "
"DFTからのずれが大きくなります。このことは、汎用MLIPでは\\ 小変位の強誘電的不安定性と、大変位の非調和的な反発壁を同時に高精度に\\ "
"再現することが難しい場合があることを示しています\\ （曲率と壁を分けて評価する理由は技術ノートの\\ `二重井戸ポテンシャル <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#double-well-"
"potential>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"Sehrawat et al. trained an ACE potential specifically for BaTiO₃ \\  and "
"reported that it closely reproduced the DFT double-well potential, \\  "
"with differences from DFT generally within 20 meV/f.u. \\  even at large "
"Ti displacements (0.1 Å or more) :sup:`[1]`. In our calculations at "
":math:`a_0`, each MLIP differed relatively little from DFT, \\  but at "
"large displacements at :math:`1.05a_0`, SevenNet and FairChem \\  "
"deviated more substantially from DFT. This indicates that a general-"
"purpose MLIP may struggle \\  to reproduce both the ferroelectric "
"instability at small displacements \\  and the anharmonic repulsive walls"
" at large displacements with high accuracy \\  (for why the curvature and"
" the walls are assessed separately, see \\  `double-well potential <https"
"://technical-notes.quemix.com/solid/soft_mode.html#double-well-"
"potential>`__ in the Technical Notes)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:443
msgid ""
"以上より、:math:`a_0` における強誘電的不安定性の確認には SevenNet と FairChem が\\ CHGNet "
"よりも明瞭な負の曲率を与えます。一方、:math:`1.05a_0` ではすべてのMLIPが\\ "
"二重井戸を示し、高対称位置の周囲に局所極性極小が存在する描像と\\ "
"整合します。ただし、この一自由度の静的曲線だけでは、高温常誘電相の多次元自由エネルギー面や\\ "
"局所極小間の遷移頻度を証明できません。DFTとの定量的比較では、\\ 体積拡大および大変位領域におけるMLIP依存性が大きいため、\\ "
"最終的な基準としてはDFTとの比較が不可欠です。"
msgstr ""
"These results show that, at :math:`a_0`, SevenNet and FairChem give more "
"pronounced negative curvature \\  than CHGNet when assessing the "
"ferroelectric instability. At :math:`1.05a_0`, by contrast, all MLIPs \\"
"  show a double well, consistent with the presence of local polar minima "
"\\  around the high-symmetry position. This one-dimensional static curve "
"alone, however, cannot establish the multidimensional free-energy surface"
" of the high-temperature paraelectric phase \\  or the frequency of "
"transitions between local minima. The results depend strongly on the "
"choice of MLIP when the volume is expanded \\  and displacements are "
"large. \\  Quantitative assessment therefore requires comparison with a "
"DFT reference."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:452
msgid "まとめ"
msgstr "Summary"

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:454
msgid ""
"格子を広げると、Ti を :math:`[001]` に変位させたときの二重井戸が深くなりました。\\ 基準の格子定数 :math:`a_0` "
"でも、Ti がわずかに中心からずれるとエネルギーが下がり、強誘電的不安定性が現れました。"
msgstr ""
"Expanding the lattice deepened the double well for Ti displacement along "
":math:`[001]`. \\  Even at the reference lattice constant :math:`a_0`, a "
"slight displacement of Ti from the center lowered the energy, revealing a"
" ferroelectric instability."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:457
msgid ""
"MLIPの比較では、SevenNet と FairChem は :math:`a_0` における小変位領域の\\ "
"負の曲率をよく再現し、強誘電的不安定性を確認するうえで有効です。\\ 一方、CHGNet は :math:`a_0` "
"では不安定性を過小評価しますが、:math:`1.05a_0` では\\ 二重井戸を定性的に再現しました。\\ "
"この結果は、MLIPによるBaTiO₃の強誘電性評価では、全変位範囲での MAE だけでなく、\\ "
"小変位領域の曲率および大変位領域の非調和性を個別に確認する必要があることを示しています\\ （技術ノートの\\ `調べたい性質ごとに検証する "
"<https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html#mlip-validation>`__）。"
msgstr ""
"SevenNet and FairChem reproduce the negative curvature well at small "
"displacements at :math:`a_0`, \\  which makes them useful for identifying"
" the ferroelectric instability. \\  CHGNet, by contrast, underestimates "
"the instability at :math:`a_0`, but it qualitatively reproduced \\  the "
"double well at :math:`1.05a_0` in our calculations. \\  These results "
"show that assessing ferroelectricity in BaTiO₃ with MLIPs requires "
"looking beyond the MAE over the full displacement range \\  to check the "
"curvature at small displacements and the anharmonicity at large "
"displacements separately \\  (see \\  `validating the properties of "
"interest <https://technical-notes.quemix.com/md/mlip.html#mlip-"
"validation>`__ in the Technical Notes)."

#: ../../BaTiO3/total-energy-DFT-MLIP.rst:465
msgid ""
"Ti が中心からずれるとエネルギーが下がることは、BaTiO₃ の強誘電性の起源を理解する出発点になります。\\ :doc:`Part 2 "
"<total-energy>` では、Ba・Ti・O の協同変位を含めて調べます。"
msgstr ""
"The decrease in energy when Ti moves off center is a starting point for "
"understanding the origin of ferroelectricity in BaTiO₃. \\  :doc:`Part 2 "
"<total-energy>` extends the analysis to include cooperative displacements"
" of Ba, Ti, and O."

